{"content":"h01.\n\n**`s3presign.Runner`** — every **12 hours** (`time.NewTicker(12h)`, with an immediate `RunOnce` at boot) — wired in `server/server.go:162–171` inside `Server.startBackgroundRunners`, which is called from `Server.Start` at `server/server.go:129`.\n\nThe runner (`server/runner/s3presign/runner.go`) iterates all S3-stored attachments in batches, checks each attachment's `LastPresignedTime`, and re-presigns any whose presigned URL will expire within the next day (presigned URLs are valid for 5 days; the runner skips anything presigned less than 4 days ago). It writes the fresh presigned URL back to the attachment's `Reference` field and updates `LastPresignedTime`, keeping external S3 links from going stale.\n\n**Component** — `s3presign.Runner` (`server/runner/s3presign/runner.go`)  \n**Schedule** — every 12 hours (plus once immediately on startup) (`runner.go:27`)  \n**Wiring site** — `server/server.go:162` (inside `startBackgroundRunners`, called at line 129 during `Server.Start`)","iteration":10,"turn":1,"type":"assistant"}
